WEBVTT

1
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,416
<i>Selamat ulang tahun, Risa.</i>

2
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:52,458
<i>Tahun ini,</i>

3
00:00:52,541 --> 00:00:54,791
<i>aku cuma mau teman</i>

4
00:00:54,875 --> 00:00:57,375
<i>supaya enggak sendirian lagi.</i>

5
00:01:12,708 --> 00:01:13,875
Aku boleh ikut main?

6
00:01:13,958 --> 00:01:15,375
- Risa!
- Risa!

7
00:01:15,458 --> 00:01:18,333
Aku enggak bohong!
Teman-teman aku beneran ada!

8
00:01:18,416 --> 00:01:19,916
Risa!

9
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,083
<i>Risa, kamu sudah besar.</i>

10
00:01:26,166 --> 00:01:28,791
<i>Hari ini kita tidak
bermain bersama lagi, Risa?</i>

11
00:01:28,875 --> 00:01:31,625
Sekarang aku sedang tidak
bisa bermain dengan kalian.

12
00:01:31,708 --> 00:01:35,333
Peter! William! Janshen! Hans! Hendrick!

13
00:01:35,416 --> 00:01:37,916
<i>Aku tahu, ya, itu ulah kalian!</i>

14
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,833
Aku capek sama kalian!

15
00:01:40,916 --> 00:01:43,291
Aku udah enggak mau peduli lagi,
ya, sama kalian!

16
00:01:43,375 --> 00:01:46,541
Aku udah enggak mau melihat kalian lagi!

17
00:01:46,625 --> 00:01:49,333
<i>Tidak baik kamu
terus hidup bersama kami, Risa.</i>

18
00:01:49,416 --> 00:01:51,083
Benar, Risa.

19
00:01:51,166 --> 00:01:53,416
Kalau tidak ada aku dan teman-teman,

20
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:57,041
kamu tidak akan diganggu
perempuan-perempuan jelek lagi.

21
00:01:57,875 --> 00:02:01,250
Kami akan selalu sayang kepadamu, Risa.

22
00:02:01,750 --> 00:02:05,208
Kami tidak akan pernah melupakanmu, Risa.

23
00:02:06,250 --> 00:02:10,000
Terima kasih untuk mainan
yang kamu berikan selama ini.

24
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:15,166
Percayalah.

25
00:02:15,250 --> 00:02:17,750
Ini yang terbaik untukmu, Risa.

26
00:02:20,291 --> 00:02:22,791
Jaga dirimu baik-baik, Risa.

27
00:03:18,958 --> 00:03:21,208
KISAH RISA SARASWATI

28
00:05:06,625 --> 00:05:11,333
<i>Selamat ulang tahun</i>

29
00:05:11,416 --> 00:05:15,291
<i>Selamat ulang tahun</i>

30
00:05:15,375 --> 00:05:19,041
<i>Selamat ulang tahun</i>

31
00:05:19,125 --> 00:05:21,458
<i>Selamat ulang tahun, Riri</i>

32
00:05:29,375 --> 00:05:34,125
<i>Selamat ulang tahun, Riri</i>

33
00:05:35,583 --> 00:05:36,875
Berdoa dulu!

34
00:05:42,375 --> 00:05:43,458
Ini buat kamu.

35
00:05:43,541 --> 00:05:45,000
Terima kasih.

36
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:49,833
Ri.

37
00:05:50,875 --> 00:05:53,791
Sebenarnya masih ada satu hadiah lagi
yang mau aku kasih.

38
00:06:07,125 --> 00:06:08,083
Riri...

39
00:06:09,041 --> 00:06:10,541
Maukah kamu menikah denganku?

40
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,416
Kak Laras.

41
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:25,291
Selamat ya, Riri.

42
00:07:25,375 --> 00:07:26,875
Makasih, Kak.

43
00:07:28,125 --> 00:07:29,708
Saya ada hadiah untuk kamu.

44
00:07:52,250 --> 00:07:54,750
Saya melihat kamu menari sejak kecil.

45
00:07:57,375 --> 00:07:59,000
Kamu sangat berbakat.

46
00:08:02,666 --> 00:08:06,875
Masih banyak kesempatan
untukmu bersinar di atas panggung.

47
00:08:23,291 --> 00:08:26,541
Pernikahan akan
menghancurkan mimpimu, Riri.

48
00:08:28,541 --> 00:08:29,750
Maksudnya?

49
00:08:57,250 --> 00:08:58,541
Kak Laras?

50
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,500
Teteh masih enggak nyangka

51
00:09:08,416 --> 00:09:10,208
Dimas bisa seromantis itu.

52
00:09:12,291 --> 00:09:13,916
Bagus lagi pilihan cincinnya.

53
00:09:15,125 --> 00:09:16,250
Cocok sama kamu.

54
00:09:17,750 --> 00:09:19,000
Cantik, ya, Teh?

55
00:09:20,791 --> 00:09:22,458
Ya, kebesaran, sih.

56
00:09:24,375 --> 00:09:25,875
Bisa dikecilin ini.

57
00:09:30,791 --> 00:09:32,500
Ini nih

58
00:09:33,125 --> 00:09:36,291
adik Teteh yang suka main boneka-bonekaan,

59
00:09:36,375 --> 00:09:38,500
sekarang udah mau jadi istri!

60
00:09:40,166 --> 00:09:45,666
Emangnya kamu bisa bangun pagi,
masak, bikin sarapan buat suami?

61
00:09:45,750 --> 00:09:47,875
Enak aja, bisa, Teh!

62
00:09:55,083 --> 00:09:55,916
Teh.

63
00:09:57,791 --> 00:09:59,541
Teteh benar enggak apa-apa

64
00:10:00,250 --> 00:10:01,916
kalau Riri nikah duluan?

65
00:10:07,333 --> 00:10:08,708
Enggak apa-apa.

66
00:10:11,375 --> 00:10:13,500
Lagian Dimas juga udah mapan.

67
00:10:14,083 --> 00:10:16,291
Ya, daripada nunggu lama,

68
00:10:17,375 --> 00:10:18,666
terus nanti

69
00:10:19,250 --> 00:10:21,041
sama-sama sibuk,

70
00:10:21,125 --> 00:10:22,416
LDR...

71
00:10:23,750 --> 00:10:25,625
Ujung-ujungnya putus kaya Teteh.

72
00:10:28,250 --> 00:10:29,791
Kok gitu sih, Teh, ngomongnya?

73
00:10:30,750 --> 00:10:33,125
Riri benar enggak enak sama Teteh.

74
00:10:39,250 --> 00:10:40,750
Teteh enggak apa-apa.

75
00:10:42,750 --> 00:10:45,000
Yang penting itu kamunya yakin.

76
00:10:48,500 --> 00:10:50,375
Lagian, zaman sekarang

77
00:10:50,458 --> 00:10:53,083
enggak harus yang lebih tua nikah duluan.

78
00:10:57,458 --> 00:10:58,708
Kamu nangis gitu, sih?

79
00:11:00,291 --> 00:11:02,166
Mau nikah kok <i>mellow?</i>

80
00:11:02,250 --> 00:11:03,375
Enggak.

81
00:11:05,333 --> 00:11:07,250
Harusnya tuh yang sedih Teteh.

82
00:11:08,291 --> 00:11:10,000
Rumah jadi sepi.

83
00:11:10,625 --> 00:11:12,166
Enggak ada lagi nanti yang,

84
00:11:12,250 --> 00:11:14,541
"Teh! Ini Riri mana?

85
00:11:14,625 --> 00:11:16,375
Teh, di mana?"

86
00:11:20,916 --> 00:11:22,125
Ya udah.

87
00:11:22,791 --> 00:11:24,666
Riri mau tidur di sini aja malam ini.

88
00:11:25,166 --> 00:11:26,750
Nemenin Teteh aja.

89
00:11:26,833 --> 00:11:29,666
Halah, bilang aja kamu yang kolokan.
Udah, sana. Sempit.

90
00:11:29,750 --> 00:11:32,125
Enggak, Teteh kan kangen sama Riri.

91
00:11:34,625 --> 00:11:35,625
Dasar.

92
00:12:32,791 --> 00:12:33,791
Ma?

93
00:12:36,625 --> 00:12:38,000
Mang Asep?

94
00:14:17,625 --> 00:14:19,375
Aku mau cerita.

95
00:14:22,375 --> 00:14:23,750
Sekarang,

96
00:14:23,833 --> 00:14:25,750
Riri udah mau nikah.

97
00:14:28,916 --> 00:14:30,541
Aku dilangkahi.

98
00:14:39,250 --> 00:14:40,416
Peter.

99
00:14:42,291 --> 00:14:43,416
William.

100
00:14:44,333 --> 00:14:45,791
Janshen.

101
00:14:49,375 --> 00:14:50,500
Hans.

102
00:14:51,625 --> 00:14:53,125
Hendrick.

103
00:14:58,250 --> 00:15:00,250
Kangen banget sama kalian.

104
00:16:28,833 --> 00:16:31,125
Boleh, Ma, enggak apa-apa. Aku ikut aja.

105
00:16:33,791 --> 00:16:36,250
Nanti dibahas kalau orangnya udah ada, ya.

106
00:16:54,166 --> 00:16:55,375
Ini orangnya datang.

107
00:16:55,458 --> 00:16:57,375
Pas lagi diomongin.

108
00:17:00,541 --> 00:17:03,958
Ri, Uwak Eti sama Tante Erni mau ke sini,

109
00:17:04,041 --> 00:17:06,583
mau bahas soal persiapan nikah.

110
00:17:06,666 --> 00:17:08,416
Kamu sama Dimas ikutan, ya.

111
00:17:09,416 --> 00:17:11,708
Banyak atuh yang harus dibahas.

112
00:17:12,208 --> 00:17:15,208
Ada langkahan, ada siraman,

113
00:17:15,291 --> 00:17:18,666
terus keluarganya Dimas <i>teh</i>
mau bikin acara lamaran <i>teu?</i>

114
00:17:22,125 --> 00:17:23,291
Ri?

115
00:17:29,250 --> 00:17:30,541
Riri.

116
00:17:31,416 --> 00:17:34,250
Sebaiknya selama persiapan nikah

117
00:17:34,333 --> 00:17:36,500
sok atuh dikurangi sedikit latihannya...

118
00:17:36,583 --> 00:17:38,583
Astagfirullahaladzim! Riri!

119
00:17:40,125 --> 00:17:41,375
Ma, maaf.

120
00:17:41,458 --> 00:17:43,583
Udah, Teteh aja.

121
00:17:43,666 --> 00:17:45,041
Hati-hati atuh.

122
00:18:02,166 --> 00:18:03,000
Awas kena beling.

123
00:18:18,166 --> 00:18:20,000
Nanti mau Teteh jemput jam berapa, Ri?

124
00:18:20,666 --> 00:18:22,875
Enggak usah, Teh.
Nanti Dimas aja yang jemput.

125
00:18:29,291 --> 00:18:30,416
Kamu hati-hati, ya, Ri.

126
00:18:31,541 --> 00:18:33,416
- Jangan capek-capek.
- Iya.

127
00:19:01,333 --> 00:19:03,916
Astaga, Riri.

128
00:19:12,041 --> 00:19:13,458
Halo? Dimas?

129
00:19:14,500 --> 00:19:17,291
Iya, ini Riri <i>handphone</i>-nya
ketinggalan di mobil.

130
00:19:19,500 --> 00:19:21,541
Ya udah, nanti aku sampaiin, ya.

131
00:19:54,083 --> 00:19:55,250
Ri?

132
00:20:13,583 --> 00:20:14,708
Ri?

133
00:21:37,916 --> 00:21:39,875
Jangan!

134
00:21:39,958 --> 00:21:41,333
Jangan!

135
00:21:47,666 --> 00:21:48,541
{\an8}Jangan!

136
00:21:50,375 --> 00:21:51,708
Buka!

137
00:21:51,791 --> 00:21:53,000
Buka!

138
00:21:53,083 --> 00:21:54,666
Tolong!

139
00:21:56,750 --> 00:21:57,750
Tolong!

140
00:21:57,833 --> 00:21:59,875
{\an8}Tolong, buka!

141
00:21:59,958 --> 00:22:01,625
{\an8}Buka, tolong!

142
00:22:01,708 --> 00:22:04,375
Tolong! Buka!

143
00:22:04,458 --> 00:22:05,416
Buka!

144
00:22:36,166 --> 00:22:37,416
Teh?

145
00:22:39,916 --> 00:22:41,791
Teteh ngapain di sini?

146
00:22:48,125 --> 00:22:49,958
Perasaan Teteh enggak enak, Ri.

147
00:22:52,333 --> 00:22:54,666
Kamu hati-hati, ya?

148
00:23:00,625 --> 00:23:03,791
Teteh ke sini mau antar <i>handphone</i> kamu.

149
00:23:03,875 --> 00:23:06,291
Tadi Dimas kirim nge-<i>chat</i> sama telepon...

150
00:24:16,291 --> 00:24:19,458
Tan, tahu tempat
buat ngecilin cincin enggak?

151
00:24:19,541 --> 00:24:21,166
Kamu dilamar?

152
00:24:22,791 --> 00:24:24,291
Adik aku yang dilamar.

153
00:24:25,250 --> 00:24:26,666
Dilangkahin.

154
00:24:32,000 --> 00:24:34,000
Harga diri atuh, Risa.

155
00:25:19,791 --> 00:25:21,125
Siapa?

156
00:26:44,958 --> 00:26:46,166
Hendrick!

157
00:27:29,416 --> 00:27:30,416
Hans?

158
00:27:35,625 --> 00:27:36,625
Hendrick?

159
00:27:39,208 --> 00:27:40,833
Aku tadi lihat kamu.

160
00:28:15,083 --> 00:28:16,291
Hans?

161
00:28:20,000 --> 00:28:21,125
Hendrick?

162
00:28:40,083 --> 00:28:43,000
Dia masih belum bisa melihat kita, ya?

163
00:29:40,541 --> 00:29:41,583
Buka!

164
00:29:42,208 --> 00:29:43,041
Buka!

165
00:29:48,166 --> 00:29:49,500
Tolong!

166
00:29:49,583 --> 00:29:50,958
Tolong!

167
00:29:51,041 --> 00:29:52,291
Buka!

168
00:29:52,875 --> 00:29:54,500
<i>Riri...</i>

169
00:30:04,666 --> 00:30:06,291
<i>Riri...</i>

170
00:30:08,500 --> 00:30:09,750
Siapa?

171
00:30:14,625 --> 00:30:15,750
Siapa?

172
00:30:28,833 --> 00:30:32,791
<i>Namaku...</i>

173
00:30:37,041 --> 00:30:38,583
<i>Canting.</i>

174
00:31:29,041 --> 00:31:30,041
Ri?

175
00:31:33,833 --> 00:31:35,416
Kamu belum selesai?

176
00:31:46,500 --> 00:31:47,708
Riri?

177
00:31:58,500 --> 00:31:59,666
Ri?

178
00:32:12,333 --> 00:32:13,208
Riri!

179
00:32:15,625 --> 00:32:18,125
Biarkan dia menari.

180
00:32:18,208 --> 00:32:20,291
Kamu tak bisa menghentikanku.

181
00:32:21,166 --> 00:32:22,375
Ri!

182
00:32:23,625 --> 00:32:24,958
Kamu ngapain di sini?

183
00:32:25,041 --> 00:32:26,875
Aku jemput kamu.

184
00:32:28,791 --> 00:32:30,041
Loh, Riri.

185
00:32:30,125 --> 00:32:30,958
Ini kamu kenapa?

186
00:32:33,833 --> 00:32:35,083
Riri!

187
00:32:41,500 --> 00:32:42,375
Ri!

188
00:32:45,625 --> 00:32:46,750
Riri!

189
00:32:47,833 --> 00:32:49,000
Hei.

190
00:32:59,833 --> 00:33:00,708
Ri.

191
00:33:04,166 --> 00:33:06,708
Ri, aku enggak pernah
lihat kamu nari kaya tadi.

192
00:33:09,375 --> 00:33:12,500
Terus tadi kamu ngomong pakai Bahasa Sunda

193
00:33:12,583 --> 00:33:14,750
yang aku enggak ngerti maksudnya apa.

194
00:33:18,333 --> 00:33:20,166
Udah gitu, tangan kamu memar lagi.

195
00:33:21,875 --> 00:33:23,208
Kamu kenapa, Ri?

196
00:33:34,708 --> 00:33:36,041
Kamu marah?

197
00:33:40,666 --> 00:33:42,583
Ya sudah, aku minta maaf ya kalau...

198
00:33:43,958 --> 00:33:45,208
aku khawatir.

199
00:34:38,708 --> 00:34:39,708
Riri.

200
00:34:42,375 --> 00:34:43,625
Kok ninggalin?

201
00:34:44,958 --> 00:34:46,750
Tadi kamu bukannya...

202
00:34:46,833 --> 00:34:48,250
Ayo jalan.

203
00:34:48,333 --> 00:34:49,666
Udah ditungguin Mama.

204
00:35:03,708 --> 00:35:04,666
<i>Iya, A.</i>

205
00:35:05,541 --> 00:35:07,291
Waalaikumsalam.

206
00:35:11,500 --> 00:35:12,708
Bagaimana, Teh?

207
00:35:12,791 --> 00:35:14,750
Si Aa kapan pulang?

208
00:35:14,833 --> 00:35:17,416
Begitu sudah dipilih tanggalnya.

209
00:35:17,500 --> 00:35:20,416
Masa anaknya mau nikah masih juga kerja.

210
00:35:21,583 --> 00:35:23,916
Pernikahan <i>teh</i> niat baik.

211
00:35:24,000 --> 00:35:26,000
Sok atuh disegerakan.

212
00:35:27,125 --> 00:35:29,791
Jangan lupakan acara langkahan.

213
00:35:30,500 --> 00:35:32,166
Acara lamaran tidak perlu.

214
00:35:32,250 --> 00:35:34,458
Langsung aja ke siraman.

215
00:35:34,541 --> 00:35:36,250
Mau kapan?

216
00:35:36,833 --> 00:35:39,500
Nanti dicari tanggal baiknya.

217
00:35:39,583 --> 00:35:43,083
Lagi pula ini <i>teh</i> si Riri juga
masih sibuk latihan balet.

218
00:35:43,625 --> 00:35:45,541
Mau nikah masih latihan balet?

219
00:35:45,625 --> 00:35:47,000
Siapa yang mau nikah?

220
00:35:48,541 --> 00:35:49,625
Riri?

221
00:35:49,708 --> 00:35:51,250
Pamali atuh.

222
00:35:51,333 --> 00:35:53,666
Masa calon pengantin ngomongnya begitu?

223
00:36:01,375 --> 00:36:03,625
Ini Riri memang

224
00:36:03,708 --> 00:36:04,958
suka bercanda.

225
00:36:06,000 --> 00:36:08,833
Sok atuh kita bicara yang lain dulu.

226
00:36:43,916 --> 00:36:44,916
Ma?

227
00:36:49,041 --> 00:36:52,708
<i>Ini NIROM di Bandung.</i>

228
00:36:52,791 --> 00:36:56,041
<i>Saat ini tanggal 7 Maret 1942,</i>

229
00:36:56,125 --> 00:36:57,416
<i>pukul 20.00.</i>

230
00:36:57,916 --> 00:36:59,916
<i>Nippon sudah menduduki Lembang.</i>

231
00:37:00,416 --> 00:37:02,208
<i>Bersiaplah, kemungkinan malam ini</i>

232
00:37:02,291 --> 00:37:04,708
<i>mereka akan menguasai
seluruh penjuru tanah ini.</i>

233
00:37:04,791 --> 00:37:06,083
<i>Selamat tinggal</i>

234
00:37:06,166 --> 00:37:08,541
<i>sampai waktu yang lebih baik.</i>

235
00:37:08,625 --> 00:37:10,250
<i>Hidup negara kita.</i>

236
00:37:10,333 --> 00:37:11,625
<i>Hidup sang Ratu.</i>

237
00:38:17,250 --> 00:38:18,583
William!

238
00:38:20,333 --> 00:38:21,166
<i>Teh?</i>

239
00:38:22,000 --> 00:38:23,291
Teteh kenapa?

240
00:38:40,208 --> 00:38:42,708
Sakit, kan, yang mereka rasakan?

241
00:38:45,291 --> 00:38:46,625
Biar dia yang nikah.

242
00:38:46,708 --> 00:38:47,916
Saya enggak akan.

243
00:38:50,166 --> 00:38:51,375
- Riri?
- Riri?

244
00:39:04,166 --> 00:39:05,041
Ri?

245
00:39:05,625 --> 00:39:07,041
Ri, buka, Ri.

246
00:39:08,166 --> 00:39:09,041
Ri?

247
00:39:09,750 --> 00:39:12,208
Kenapa kamu bilang Teteh aja yang nikah?

248
00:39:12,791 --> 00:39:14,375
Kenapa kamu bilang gitu, Ri?

249
00:39:16,416 --> 00:39:18,125
Riri, tadi kamu sebut "mereka".

250
00:39:18,208 --> 00:39:19,625
"Mereka" siapa, Ri?

251
00:39:19,708 --> 00:39:21,166
Teman-teman Teteh?

252
00:39:21,666 --> 00:39:23,375
Kenapa kamu sebut mereka?

253
00:39:23,916 --> 00:39:25,291
Mereka di mana, Ri?

254
00:39:25,375 --> 00:39:27,166
Kamu tahu apa soal mereka?

255
00:39:28,458 --> 00:39:29,333
Ri?

256
00:39:29,416 --> 00:39:30,458
Riri!

257
00:39:31,750 --> 00:39:32,916
Riri, jawab Teteh.

258
00:40:07,500 --> 00:40:08,708
Ri?

259
00:40:13,416 --> 00:40:14,958
Kamu kenapa?

260
00:40:17,041 --> 00:40:18,666
Cerita sama Teteh.

261
00:40:25,500 --> 00:40:28,291
Beri tahu teman-temanmu...

262
00:40:29,750 --> 00:40:34,125
mereka takkan bisa menghentikanku.

263
00:41:09,416 --> 00:41:10,458
Keluar.

264
00:41:11,041 --> 00:41:13,000
- Ri.
- Aku capek.

265
00:41:33,750 --> 00:41:35,625
Dadah, Teh.

266
00:41:52,375 --> 00:41:53,375
Teh Risa.

267
00:41:57,625 --> 00:41:59,750
Mau titip balikin ini ke Riri.

268
00:42:07,416 --> 00:42:09,250
Ini tuh cincinnya kegedean, Dim.

269
00:42:11,125 --> 00:42:13,541
Enggak apa-apa,
nanti biar Teteh yang kecilin, ya.

270
00:42:15,791 --> 00:42:17,458
Riri tuh kenapa ya, Teh?

271
00:42:19,958 --> 00:42:23,416
Apa ini karena pamali ya,
kita ngelangkahin Teh Risa?

272
00:42:23,500 --> 00:42:25,083
Kamu ngomongnya gitu sih, Dim?

273
00:42:25,833 --> 00:42:28,000
Teteh ikhlas kok kalian nikah.

274
00:42:29,166 --> 00:42:30,541
Riri itu...

275
00:42:32,833 --> 00:42:34,083
tadi aneh banget, Teh.

276
00:42:35,500 --> 00:42:38,250
Dan aku tahu kalau ada mitosnya.

277
00:42:38,333 --> 00:42:41,875
Adik yang ngelangkahin kakaknya menikah
itu pasti ada gangguannya, Teh.

278
00:42:46,625 --> 00:42:48,458
Teh Risa ngerasain ada sesuatu enggak?

279
00:42:58,625 --> 00:43:00,958
Emang tadi ada kejadian apa sama Riri?

280
00:43:05,166 --> 00:43:06,750
Tadi pas aku jemput Riri...

281
00:43:08,458 --> 00:43:10,500
Riri itu nari sendirian, Teh.

282
00:43:11,875 --> 00:43:13,875
Dan dia ngomong pakai Bahasa Sunda.

283
00:43:15,125 --> 00:43:16,958
Udah gitu, ada memar di tangannya.

284
00:43:18,416 --> 00:43:20,250
Terus, pas dia masuk mobil...

285
00:43:25,125 --> 00:43:28,291
Teh Risa ngelihat ada sesuatu enggak sih,
di gedung pertunjukan?

286
00:43:33,166 --> 00:43:35,583
Teteh sudah enggak bisa ngelihat, Dim.

287
00:43:36,750 --> 00:43:38,041
Maaf, ya.

288
00:43:39,875 --> 00:43:41,875
Tapi Teteh janji, Riri akan baik-baik aja.

289
00:43:43,500 --> 00:43:45,708
Kita sama-sama bantu Riri ya, Dim?

290
00:44:32,500 --> 00:44:33,541
Peter.

291
00:44:34,708 --> 00:44:35,708
William.

292
00:44:36,833 --> 00:44:37,833
Janshen.

293
00:44:39,125 --> 00:44:40,125
Hans.

294
00:44:40,625 --> 00:44:41,833
Hendrick.

295
00:44:45,958 --> 00:44:49,916
Aku tahu yang aku alami
ada hubungannya sama kalian.

296
00:44:53,083 --> 00:44:54,125
Itu semua

297
00:44:54,833 --> 00:44:56,500
kematian kalian?

298
00:44:58,625 --> 00:45:01,333
Kenapa aku harus merasakannya?

299
00:45:04,583 --> 00:45:06,916
Apa ini ada hubungannya sama Riri?

300
00:45:09,208 --> 00:45:10,416
Peter...

301
00:45:11,291 --> 00:45:12,708
Tolong.

302
00:45:13,541 --> 00:45:15,291
Aku takut.

303
00:46:01,500 --> 00:46:02,875
- Risa.
- Risa?

304
00:46:02,958 --> 00:46:03,958
Risa!

305
00:46:29,958 --> 00:46:32,208
Dia masih belum bisa melihat kita.

306
00:46:33,041 --> 00:46:35,458
Ayo kita rasuki Risa sekarang, Peter.

307
00:46:35,541 --> 00:46:36,666
Jangan.

308
00:46:36,750 --> 00:46:38,958
William sudah merasuki Risa malam ini.

309
00:46:39,541 --> 00:46:41,708
Kematian William sangat menyakitkan.

310
00:46:42,666 --> 00:46:46,000
Tubuh Risa tidak akan kuat
merasakan kematian lagi malam ini.

311
00:47:05,458 --> 00:47:08,666
Jadi, besok bunganya
dikirim jam lima atau jam enam?

312
00:47:10,458 --> 00:47:12,041
Jam enam.

313
00:47:15,541 --> 00:47:16,625
Sisa pembayarannya

314
00:47:16,708 --> 00:47:19,916
dibayar besok
sekalian bunganya dikirim, ya?

315
00:47:22,000 --> 00:47:24,000
Iya, makasih.

316
00:47:31,875 --> 00:47:34,708
Teteh udah siap
untuk acara langkahan besok?

317
00:47:35,750 --> 00:47:38,000
Soalnya kalau Teteh belum siap,

318
00:47:38,083 --> 00:47:39,958
banyak pamalinya.

319
00:47:52,583 --> 00:47:54,291
Teteh kenapa?

320
00:47:56,000 --> 00:47:57,333
Enggak apa-apa.

321
00:47:58,916 --> 00:48:00,166
Teh...

322
00:48:01,291 --> 00:48:03,041
kalau memang Teteh belum ikhlas...

323
00:48:03,125 --> 00:48:05,041
Ma, jangan ngomong gitu.

324
00:48:07,500 --> 00:48:09,291
Teteh ikhlas, kok.

325
00:48:10,416 --> 00:48:12,708
Teteh juga ikut bahagia Riri nikah.

326
00:48:14,583 --> 00:48:16,291
Terus Teteh kenapa?

327
00:48:16,375 --> 00:48:18,416
Cerita atuh sama Mama.

328
00:48:24,875 --> 00:48:26,333
Sebenarnya...

329
00:48:29,708 --> 00:48:32,041
Sebenarnya akhir-akhir ini
Teteh ngerasa aneh.

330
00:48:34,416 --> 00:48:36,958
Badan Teteh, semuanya, enggak enak.

331
00:48:39,875 --> 00:48:41,375
Kaya ngalamin kerasukan.

332
00:48:44,000 --> 00:48:45,500
Mama tahu, kan?

333
00:48:45,583 --> 00:48:48,625
Teteh sudah lama enggak
bisa lihat teman-teman kecil Teteh?

334
00:48:53,458 --> 00:48:55,166
Tapi akhir-akhir ini...

335
00:48:56,958 --> 00:48:59,958
Teteh merasa mereka kayak
mau nyampaiin sesuatu.

336
00:49:02,125 --> 00:49:04,250
Takutnya ada hubungannya sama Riri.

337
00:49:06,750 --> 00:49:08,666
Jadi, ada yang gangguin Riri?

338
00:49:08,750 --> 00:49:09,625
Iya, Teh?

339
00:49:09,708 --> 00:49:12,416
Teteh coba cari jawabannya secepatnya, ya.

340
00:49:14,333 --> 00:49:15,458
Tapi Teteh janji,

341
00:49:16,333 --> 00:49:17,750
semuanya akan baik-baik aja.

342
00:49:22,333 --> 00:49:23,333
Teh.

343
00:49:23,833 --> 00:49:26,375
Teteh ingat enggak waktu kecil

344
00:49:26,458 --> 00:49:28,708
ada orang pintar yang bantu Teteh?

345
00:49:28,791 --> 00:49:32,666
Yang Mama mintain tolong
untuk tutup mata batin Teteh.

346
00:49:59,333 --> 00:50:00,958
Apa kabar, Risa?

347
00:50:05,500 --> 00:50:07,208
Kamu sudah besar.

348
00:50:16,625 --> 00:50:19,666
<i>Sudah lama saya tidak melihat hantu.</i>

349
00:50:23,625 --> 00:50:25,916
Mencium bau danur pun tidak.

350
00:50:26,000 --> 00:50:27,375
Mereka akan terlihat

351
00:50:28,125 --> 00:50:31,166
jika mereka mau memperlihatkan diri.

352
00:50:36,083 --> 00:50:37,750
Tapi akhir-akhir ini...

353
00:50:39,666 --> 00:50:43,166
saya merasakan kehadiran
mereka di dekat saya, Mbah.

354
00:50:44,791 --> 00:50:46,625
Mereka seperti...

355
00:50:49,416 --> 00:50:51,208
merasuki saya.

356
00:50:52,708 --> 00:50:54,291
Satu per satu.

357
00:50:54,958 --> 00:50:57,750
Saya merasakan kematian mereka.

358
00:51:06,125 --> 00:51:08,083
Untung kamu tidak apa-apa.

359
00:51:08,166 --> 00:51:10,083
Tidak semua orang kuat

360
00:51:10,166 --> 00:51:12,083
mengalami kematian orang lain.

361
00:51:19,416 --> 00:51:20,750
Mungkin...

362
00:51:23,916 --> 00:51:25,416
teman-temanmu itu

363
00:51:26,333 --> 00:51:27,750
sedang berusaha.

364
00:51:29,708 --> 00:51:33,000
Mereka ingin berkomunikasi
kembali denganmu.

365
00:51:34,333 --> 00:51:36,208
Terus saya harus gimana, Mbah?

366
00:51:37,708 --> 00:51:38,583
Kapan

367
00:51:39,333 --> 00:51:40,916
saya bisa melihat mereka lagi?

368
00:51:41,000 --> 00:51:42,416
Dunia gaib

369
00:51:43,875 --> 00:51:46,500
bukan sesuatu yang kita manusia

370
00:51:47,416 --> 00:51:50,083
bisa pahami sepenuhnya, Risa.

371
00:52:55,291 --> 00:52:58,166
<i>Ini NIROM di Bandung.</i>

372
00:52:58,250 --> 00:53:01,708
<i>Pendengar, saat ini tanggal 8 Maret 1942.</i>

373
00:53:01,791 --> 00:53:03,708
<i>Semua tentara kita telah menyerah.</i>

374
00:53:04,375 --> 00:53:07,166
<i>Nippon telah menduduki seluruh tanah ini.</i>

375
00:53:29,916 --> 00:53:31,333
Janshen!

376
00:53:33,666 --> 00:53:35,000
Lari, Janshen!

377
00:55:30,583 --> 00:55:31,416
<i>Janshen.</i>

378
00:55:32,583 --> 00:55:34,166
Kenapa gigimu ompong?

379
00:55:37,750 --> 00:55:40,166
Tidak perlu aku ceritakan, Risa.

380
00:55:40,250 --> 00:55:41,500
Nanti kamu sedih.

381
00:55:50,208 --> 00:55:51,541
Janshen?

382
00:55:53,958 --> 00:55:55,166
Peter!

383
00:55:55,750 --> 00:55:57,416
William!

384
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:01,250
Hans!

385
00:56:02,166 --> 00:56:03,750
Hendrick!

386
00:56:05,833 --> 00:56:08,708
Aku tahu ini ulah kalian!

387
00:56:11,916 --> 00:56:14,541
Kalian seperti ini mau apa?

388
00:56:43,833 --> 00:56:45,416
Giliranmu, Peter.

389
00:56:45,916 --> 00:56:47,166
Coba sekarang, Peter.

390
00:56:47,666 --> 00:56:49,166
Risa harus segera melihat kita.

391
00:56:53,958 --> 00:56:55,083
Ri?

392
00:57:49,875 --> 00:57:52,041
Kita harus bagaimana, Peter?

393
00:57:52,125 --> 00:57:53,875
Dia ada di dekat Risa.

394
00:57:55,375 --> 00:57:57,791
Dia sengaja menghalangi kita.

395
00:58:09,500 --> 00:58:12,875
Sekarang waktunya buat kalian berdua,

396
00:58:13,791 --> 00:58:15,791
kakak, adik.

397
00:58:17,291 --> 00:58:21,000
Nanti kamu basuh kaki
adik kamu dengan air ini.

398
00:58:22,541 --> 00:58:25,958
Dan kamu minta dengan penuh keikhlasan

399
00:58:26,583 --> 00:58:30,458
untuk mengantarkan adik kamu
ke langkah selanjutnya.

400
00:58:39,916 --> 00:58:42,291
- Semoga lancar ya, Teh.
- Iya, Ma.

401
00:59:35,833 --> 00:59:37,083
Ri?

402
00:59:38,500 --> 00:59:40,083
Teteh izin ya, Ri?

403
00:59:59,500 --> 01:00:01,750
Teteh ke sini dengan tulus

404
01:00:02,500 --> 01:00:03,916
dan ikhlas

405
01:00:05,416 --> 01:00:07,958
menjemput kamu untuk upacara langkahan.

406
01:00:19,291 --> 01:00:21,666
Supaya pernikahan kamu lancar,

407
01:00:21,750 --> 01:00:23,041
jauh dari bala,

408
01:00:24,750 --> 01:00:26,125
dan niat buruk.

409
01:00:48,625 --> 01:00:50,000
Pernikahan

410
01:00:50,083 --> 01:00:52,166
adalah awal dari penderitaan.

411
01:02:00,041 --> 01:02:01,416
Peter!

412
01:02:01,500 --> 01:02:02,791
Cepat kemari!

413
01:02:47,958 --> 01:02:48,791
<i>Risa?</i>

414
01:02:49,416 --> 01:02:50,416
Risa?

415
01:02:51,208 --> 01:02:52,208
Teteh, bangun.

416
01:02:52,291 --> 01:02:54,166
- Ada apa dengan Teh Risa?
- Teh?

417
01:02:54,250 --> 01:02:55,541
- Teh?
- Teh?

418
01:02:55,625 --> 01:02:57,291
- Teh Risa.
- Risa!

419
01:02:58,916 --> 01:03:02,875
Teteh kenapa? Ya Allah.

420
01:03:02,958 --> 01:03:03,875
- Risa!
- Risa.

421
01:03:03,958 --> 01:03:05,375
- Teh, bangun.
- Risa.

422
01:03:05,458 --> 01:03:08,833
- Bangun, Risa. Teh, bangun.
- Bangun, Sayang.

423
01:03:08,916 --> 01:03:09,916
Risa?

424
01:03:10,583 --> 01:03:11,916
Risa?

425
01:03:12,000 --> 01:03:13,166
Risa?

426
01:03:13,250 --> 01:03:14,583
Teh Risa.

427
01:03:14,666 --> 01:03:16,583
- Teh?
- Ini kenapa?

428
01:03:16,666 --> 01:03:18,083
Ini kenapa Risa?

429
01:03:33,458 --> 01:03:34,541
Teh.

430
01:03:37,583 --> 01:03:39,166
Apa yang salah, ya?

431
01:03:39,916 --> 01:03:41,875
Kenapa jadi seperti ini?

432
01:03:44,916 --> 01:03:46,708
Apa memang pamali ya, Teh?

433
01:03:51,208 --> 01:03:54,708
Yang penting sekarang
mereka baik-baik aja, kan?

434
01:03:57,125 --> 01:03:58,833
Ya udah atuh, Teh.

435
01:03:58,916 --> 01:04:00,750
Biar Teh Eli bisa istirahat.

436
01:04:01,458 --> 01:04:03,125
- Kita mau pamit, ya.
- Yuk.

437
01:04:03,208 --> 01:04:04,333
Ya udah.

438
01:04:05,250 --> 01:04:06,541
Teteh istirahat.

439
01:04:06,625 --> 01:04:07,791
Terima kasih, ya.

440
01:04:18,416 --> 01:04:20,416
Kejadian tadi

441
01:04:20,500 --> 01:04:23,458
jangan sampai keluarganya Dimas tahu.

442
01:04:24,583 --> 01:04:25,750
Ya?

443
01:04:29,333 --> 01:04:30,916
Pulang dulu, ya.

444
01:04:56,416 --> 01:04:58,333
Risa, bangun, Risa.

445
01:04:59,291 --> 01:05:01,125
Risa, ayo main!

446
01:05:10,041 --> 01:05:11,500
- Ayo, Risa!
- Ayo, Risa!

447
01:05:15,625 --> 01:05:16,791
Tunggu!

448
01:05:19,041 --> 01:05:20,291
Peter?

449
01:05:23,041 --> 01:05:24,500
William?

450
01:05:26,875 --> 01:05:28,291
Janshen?

451
01:05:31,000 --> 01:05:31,875
Hans?

452
01:05:34,458 --> 01:05:35,708
Hendrick?

453
01:07:10,166 --> 01:07:11,208
Risa.

454
01:07:11,291 --> 01:07:12,708
Bangun, Risa.

455
01:07:32,291 --> 01:07:33,750
Ini beneran?

456
01:07:33,833 --> 01:07:35,750
Dia pikir ini mimpi.

457
01:07:36,833 --> 01:07:38,458
Ini bukan mimpi, Risa.

458
01:07:44,458 --> 01:07:47,083
Aku sangat merindukan kalian.

459
01:07:51,833 --> 01:07:54,375
Kami selalu ada di dekatmu, Risa.

460
01:07:55,458 --> 01:07:57,250
Tapi kamu tidak bisa melihat kami.

461
01:07:57,916 --> 01:08:00,666
Kami harus merasukimu satu per satu, Risa.

462
01:08:01,208 --> 01:08:03,375
Agar kamu bisa melihat kami lagi.

463
01:08:04,708 --> 01:08:07,333
Kamu terpaksa merasakan kematian kami.

464
01:08:08,750 --> 01:08:10,333
Maafkan kami, Risa.

465
01:08:16,458 --> 01:08:18,000
Maafkan aku, ya.

466
01:08:20,208 --> 01:08:23,833
Aku tidak tahu kalau kematian
kalian sebegitu menyakitkannya.

467
01:08:24,708 --> 01:08:26,541
Kami yang minta maaf, Risa.

468
01:08:27,625 --> 01:08:29,875
Kami tidak punya cara lain.

469
01:08:31,125 --> 01:08:33,125
Kami harus menolong Riri

470
01:08:33,208 --> 01:08:35,041
dari perempuan jahat itu.

471
01:08:50,416 --> 01:08:52,583
<i>Dia sudah ada sejak awal.</i>

472
01:09:00,375 --> 01:09:02,083
<i>Di saat Riri kecil,</i>

473
01:09:02,666 --> 01:09:05,458
<i>aku pernah bertemu perempuan itu
di gedung pertunjukan.</i>

474
01:09:07,583 --> 01:09:08,708
<i>Betul, Risa.</i>

475
01:09:08,791 --> 01:09:12,041
<i>Karena dia penunggu
gedung pertunjukan itu.</i>

476
01:09:15,833 --> 01:09:17,916
Namaku Canting.

477
01:09:20,291 --> 01:09:21,333
Riri?

478
01:09:21,833 --> 01:09:23,208
Kamu enggak apa-apa?

479
01:09:26,041 --> 01:09:27,291
Ri?

480
01:09:29,875 --> 01:09:31,750
Mama cuma mau...

481
01:09:35,625 --> 01:09:36,500
Ri?

482
01:09:43,541 --> 01:09:46,708
Aku tidak mau menikah...

483
01:09:49,041 --> 01:09:53,375
Aku tidak mau menikah...

484
01:09:53,458 --> 01:09:54,625
Riri?

485
01:09:55,833 --> 01:09:57,083
Riri?

486
01:09:58,666 --> 01:10:00,708
Aku tidak mau menikah...

487
01:10:02,958 --> 01:10:03,958
Ri?

488
01:10:04,041 --> 01:10:05,333
Aku tidak mau menikah...

489
01:10:05,416 --> 01:10:08,000
Riri, jangan bicara seperti itu.

490
01:10:09,250 --> 01:10:11,833
Teh Risa sudah ikhlas dilangkahi.

491
01:10:12,750 --> 01:10:15,750
Mama juga bahagia karena Riri mau nikah.

492
01:10:16,458 --> 01:10:19,625
Aku tidak mau menikah...

493
01:10:19,708 --> 01:10:20,916
Ri...

494
01:10:23,000 --> 01:10:25,333
Memangnya Riri tidak bahagia?

495
01:10:28,208 --> 01:10:29,791
Aku tidak mau menikah!

496
01:10:29,875 --> 01:10:31,541
Astagfirullahaladzim!

497
01:10:32,166 --> 01:10:33,458
Riri!

498
01:11:07,000 --> 01:11:08,166
Riri?

499
01:11:21,000 --> 01:11:21,833
Riri!

500
01:11:21,916 --> 01:11:23,750
Kamu kenapa?

501
01:11:41,916 --> 01:11:43,916
Riri... Risa!

502
01:11:44,000 --> 01:11:46,583
Risa, tolong Mama, Risa!

503
01:11:47,291 --> 01:11:48,583
Mama?

